  "description": "Theoretical and synthetic-computational analysis of identifiability limits when epigenetic-clock changes may include direct marker effects. Includes a reproducible synthetic benchmark and constrained information-gain design planner; no empirical rejuvenation or lifespan-extension claim is made.",
